# Optional: Real Email Delivery Configuration (Nodemailer / SMTP / Gmail)
# If configured, invitation emails are automatically delivered directly into recipient inboxes.
# Gmail Option:
# GMAIL_USER=lead@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_char_google_app_password

